{"4343220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCP Studies", "steam_appid": 4343220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: SCP: Studies is a first person game where you interact with SCP's, these interactions can vary from puzzles to upgrades, showcases, and yes of course horror. With everyone gone you are now in control. Correctly manage the remaining life of the facility, gather  intel and SCPs, and get out with your mind intact. Otherwise, you will be quickly met with a total containment breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting: You play as a Level 1 Researcher, as far as the Foundation knows, in the early 90’s. Site-191 is underground in the Midwest USA using a Seed Vault as a front. Use some retro tech and interactable SCPs to get what you really came for.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inception: SCP: Studies started as a side project in late 2021 to learn unreal as I worked with Aethon after my short time working on SCP:Unity as a minor developer. I started with zero knowledge in the engine, and only 3-D knowledge. However I enjoyed learning visual scripting, sound design, UI and everything else that comes with it so I decided to start working on SCP Studies as my main project.<br><br>DEMO IS OUT NOW! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Spoilers Below <br> <br>23 SCP’s Included </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-005</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-049</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-099</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-117</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-207</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-248</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-261</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-500</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-513</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-738</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1025</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1032</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1079</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1155</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1981</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-2107</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3238</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3295</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3671</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-4088</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-5739</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-6920</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more on the way!  </p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: SCP: Studies is a first person game where you interact with SCP's, these interactions can vary from puzzles to upgrades, showcases, and yes of course horror. With everyone gone you are now in control. Correctly manage the remaining life of the facility, gather  intel and SCPs, and get out with your mind intact. Otherwise, you will be quickly met with a total containment breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting: You play as a Level 1 Researcher, as far as the Foundation knows, in the early 90’s. Site-191 is underground in the Midwest USA using a Seed Vault as a front. Use some retro tech and interactable SCPs to get what you really came for.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inception: SCP: Studies started as a side project in late 2021 to learn unreal as I worked with Aethon after my short time working on SCP:Unity as a minor developer. I started with zero knowledge in the engine, and only 3-D knowledge. However I enjoyed learning visual scripting, sound design, UI and everything else that comes with it so I decided to start working on SCP Studies as my main project.<br><br>DEMO IS OUT NOW! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Spoilers Below <br> <br>23 SCP’s Included </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-005</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-049</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-099</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-117</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-207</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-248</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-261</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-500</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-513</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-738</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1025</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1032</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1079</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1155</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-1981</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-2107</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3238</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3295</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-3671</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-4088</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-5739</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-6920</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more on the way!  </p>", "short_description": "Explore a SCP Facility set in 1992, try to stay sane and finish objectives by completing everything the SCP's have to offer. Interact with anomalous objects; experience, avoid, destroy, and use them. Learn how the facility operates and try to to keep it running as long as you can.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343220/c0ff21e3f6628abc4d9a020669dd9aa9d2ff97d5/header.jpg?t=1783102904", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343220/e9c1856ec34a540effe61772bcdaceb90af740cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=178310